--------------------------------

Q. Why are template definitions kept in header files?

Compiler needs the complete definition while instantiating templates.

--------------------------------

Q. Difference between Function Overloading and Function Templates?

Function Overloading
• Multiple implementations

Function Template
• Single generic implementation

